<title>USA: GE executive joins Clayton, Dubilier &amp; Rice.</title>
<headline>GE executive joins Clayton, Dubilier &amp; Rice.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment firm Clayton, Dubilier &amp; Rice Inc said on Tuesday Charles Pieper, former president and chief executive officer of GE Lighting Europe, has joined the firm as an operating principal.</p>
<p>Pieper joins the private investment firm after 16 years at General Electric Co where he held a series of senior management positions in the United States and around the world, Clayton Dubilier said.</p>
</text>
